                  Constant(value='K7')],
                values=[
                  Constant(value='## Transformer Summary – K.1 (Routing) v2\n\n**Inputs:**\n- name: {name}\n- title: {title}\n- about: {about_snippet}\n\n**Effective Router (locked):**\n- weights: {weights}\n- thresholds: {thresholds}\n\n**Transition Detection (v20):**\n- Transition Detected: {transition_detected}\n- Original Message Type: {original_type}\n- New Message Type: {new_type}\n- Regeneration Required: {regeneration_nodes}\n\n**Parameters (from Section 3 tables):**\n- ToT Branches: {tot_branches} (C_LEVEL=7, EXECUTIVE=5, etc.)\n- Self-Consistency: {self_consistency} runs\n- Temperature: {temperature}\n- RAG Retrievers: {rag_retrievers}\n- RAG Hops: {rag_hops}\n\n**v16 RAG Enhancement:**\n- Retrievers: {retrievers}\n- Hops: {hops}\n- Hop 1: {hop1_summary}\n- Hop 2: {hop2_summary}\n- Hop 3: {hop3_summary}\n- Signal Quality Score: {signal_quality}\n\n**Features extracted:** {features}\n\n**Scores:** {scores}\n\n**Chosen route:** {chosen_route} (rule: {chosen_rule})\n\n**Self-consistency votes:** {votes}\n\n**CoT traces:**\n{cot_traces}\n\n**Confidence:** {confidence}\n\n**Audit key:** {audit_key}\n'),
                  Constant(value='## Transformer Summary – K.2 (Subject) v2\n\n**Conditional RAG Status:** {rag_triggered}\n\n**Parameters (from Section 3 tables):**\n- Message Type: {message_type}\n- ToT Branches: {tot_branches} (C_LEVEL=9, EXECUTIVE=6, etc.)\n- Self-Consistency: {self_consistency} runs\n- Temperature: {temperature}\n\n[If RAG triggered:]\n**v16 RAG Enhancement:**\n- Message Type: {message_type}\n- Retrievers: {retrievers}\n- Hops: 2\n- Hop 1 (Recent Post): {hop1_summary}\n- Hop 2 (Company News): {hop2_summary}\n- Timely Hook Found: {timely_hook_found}\n- Signal Quality Score: {signal_quality}\n\n**Candidates:**\n{subject_candidates}\n\n**Chosen subject:** {chosen_subject}\n\n**Confidence:** {confidence}\n\n**Audit key:** {audit_key}\n'),
                  Constant(value='## Transformer Summary – K.3 (Message Body) v2 HIGHEST ROI\n\n**Regeneration Status (v20):** {regeneration_status}\n[If Regenerated:]\n- Trigger: Message type transition from {original_type} to {new_type}\n- Original Length: {original_words} words\n- Expanded Length: {expanded_words} words\n- Structure Applied: {expansion_structure}\n\n**Parameters (from Section 3 tables):**\n- Message Type: {message_type}\n- ToT Branches: {tot_branches} (C_LEVEL=12-15, EXECUTIVE=10-11, etc.)\n- Self-Consistency: {self_consistency} runs (C_LEVEL=12, EXECUTIVE=7, etc.)\n- Temperature: {temperature} (C_LEVEL=0.90, EXECUTIVE=0.70, etc.)\n- Word/Char Count: {count_requirement}\n- Structure: {structure_requirement}\n\n**v17 Job Application Context:** {is_job_application}\n[If Y:]\n- Job Req Number: {job_req_number}\n- Job Title: {job_title}\n- Application Date: {application_date}\n- Enrichment Applied: Application context prepended, recipient framed as stakeholder\n\n**v16 RAG Enhancement (Priority 1):**\n- Message Type: {message_type}\n- Retrievers: {retrievers} (C_LEVEL=20, EXECUTIVE=12, etc.)\n- Hops: {hops_executed} (C_LEVEL=6, EXECUTIVE=4, etc.)\n- Hop Chain: {hop_chain_name}\n\n**Hop 1 (Company Context):**\n- Query: {hop1_query}\n- Sources: {hop1_sources}\n- Recency: {hop1_recency}\n- Key Findings: {hop1_findings}\n\n**Hop 2 (Strategic Priorities):**\n- Query: {hop2_query}\n- Extracted Priorities: {hop2_priorities}\n- Key Findings: {hop2_findings}\n\n[If 3+ hop chain:]\n**Hop 3+ (Recipient-Specific):**\n- Query: {hop3_query}\n- Sources: {hop3_sources}\n- Recipient Signals: {hop3_signals}\n- Key Findings: {hop3_findings}\n\n**Synthesis:**\n- Merge Strategy: {merge_strategy}\n- Signal Quality Score: {signal_quality}\n- Recipient-Specific Anchors: {specific_anchors}\n\n**Context layers used:** {context_layers}\n\n**Branches:** {branch_names_and_key_points}\n\n**Merged message (final):**\n{final_message}\n\n**Confidence / QA:** {confidence} / {qa_notes}\n\n**Audit key:** {audit_key}\n'),
                  Constant(value='## Transformer Summary – K.4 (Attachments) v2\n\n**Transition-Triggered Attachment (v20):** {transition_attachment}\n[If Yes:]\n- Trigger: Message type transition from {original_type} to {new_type}\n- Attachment Added: {attachment_type}\n- Reference Text: {attachment_reference}\n\n**Parameters (from Section 3 tables):**\n- Message Type: {message_type}\n- ToT Branches: {tot_branches} (C_LEVEL=5, EXECUTIVE=4, etc.)\n- Self-Consistency: {self_consistency} runs\n- Temperature: {temperature} (all types=0.15)\n- Attachment Type: {attachment_type_per_table}\n\n**Attachment candidates:** {attachment_candidates}\n\n**Chosen:** {chosen_attachment}\n\n**Link health:** {link_health}\n\n**Audit key:** {audit_key}\n'),
